  data: {
    LLM: "Keep your eyes on the group, not just your cards. Most players in Magarac lose because they are too focused on trying to complete their own set and don't notice the person next to them has already slammed.\n\nThe Stealth Pass: If you need only one card and you see the person to your right is about to pass it, prepare your slam hand. As soon as the card touches your fingers, slam itâ€”don't even look at it! If you were right, you win; if not, you've made a hilarious mistake.\n\nThe False-Start Bluff: If you are the dealer or a confident player, make a sudden movement with your hand toward the table without actually slamming. If someone echoes you and slams their hand down prematurely, they are often penalized in house rules.",
    Player: "Keep your eyes on the group, not just your cards. Most players in Magarac lose because they are too focused on trying to complete their own set and don't notice the person next to them has already slammed.\n\nThe Stealth Pass: If you need only one card and you see the person to your right is about to pass it, prepare your slam hand. As soon as the card touches your fingers, slam itâ€”don't even look at it! If you were right, you win; if not, you've made a hilarious mistake.\n\nThe False-Start Bluff: If you are the dealer or a confident player, make a sudden movement with your hand toward the table without actually slamming. If someone echoes you and slams their hand down prematurely, they are often penalized in house rules.",
