    advanced: 'The False-Start Bluff: If you are the dealer or a confident player, make a sudden movement with your hand toward the table without actually slamming. If someone echoes you and slams their hand down prematurely, they are often penalized in house rules.',
    tips: [
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Pass cards as fast as possible to overwhelm the player to your left. If they are slow, they will have a huge pile of cards to look through, making them less likely to notice someone else winning.',
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: "In the 'Stealth' version (Nose-touch), keep a finger near your face at all times.",
